    "# Founder Fade Curves Predict OSS Project Survival\\n",
    "\\n",
    "This demo notebook tests whether founder involvement fade curve descriptors provide complementary \\n",
    "predictive value beyond static features in predicting OSS project survival after founder departure. \\n",
    "\\n",
    "**Key Finding**: Static features achieve high AUC (~0.93), while fade descriptors alone perform near chance (~0.46), \\n",
    "indicating fade descriptors add no meaningful predictive value beyond static features and post-departure activity."
   ]
